            "when": "人类伙伴选择推送并创建 PR 时。",
            "rationale": "人类伙伴会在该 worktree 中继续处理 PR 反馈。",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "path": "skills/finishing-a-development-branch/SKILL.md",
                "line_start": 113,
                "line_end": 126
